s when required. Adhere to company policies, confidentiality standards, and data protection requirements. Who you are Minimum of 2 years’ experience in a front desk, receptionist, or administrative role Fintech, financial services, banking, or technology industry experience is an advantage, but not mandatory Diploma or Bachelor’s degree in Business Administration, Office Management, or a related field is preferred Skills & Competencies Excellent verbal and written communication skills. Strong interpersonal and customer service orientation. High level of professionalism, discretion, and attention to detail. Strong organisational and time management skills. Proficiency in Microsoft Office and basic office management tools. Ability to multitask and remain calm in a fast-paced environment. Basic understanding of data confidentiality and customer privacy. ‍ Apply Now Apply Company About Contact Careers Learn Support Lodge a Complaint Whistleblower Portal Our Commitment To Professional Conduct Product Fido Credit Fido Score Credit Breakdown Business Loan Impact Report ESG Report Legals Referral Program T&Cs Legal Discounts Upsales T&C Terms of Service Referral Plan T&C Commitment to info sec. End User License Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Follow Us © All rights are reserved under Fido Microcredit, 2025 Ghana (English)",
