      "description": "Back Office Representative | Fido Careers Borrow Personal Credit Business Loans Pay Save Build Credit Learn Blog Fido Academy Events Help GH Get the app Get started Back Office Representative South Africa Who we are At Fido, we are building the future of finance in Africa, powered by advanced technology, data-driven decision-making and bold thinking. Through AI, cutting edge data science and automation, we’re redefining how people access and experience financial services. Our goal is to make finance simple, smart and accessible, giving everyone the confidence to take charge of their financial story Joining Fido is an opportunity to drive real impact, solve meaningful problems and contribute to building a future where millions have the tools to create, grow and thrive. What you will do As the Back Office Representative, you will support back office operations in South Africa, ensuring seamless execution of operational processes, accurate transaction processing, and strong operational controls. You will be responsible for coordinating and executing back office activities, investigating operational issues, and ensuring timely resolution of transaction-related exceptions. This role requires close collaboration with cross-functional teams including Finance, Risk, Customer Experience, Product, Technology, and third-party operators to drive efficiency, resolve issues, and ensure smooth operational delivery. This is a critical role in ensuring operational accuracy, customer trust, and scalability in a fast-growing fintech environment. What you will do: Back Office & Transaction Operations Perform daily transaction monitoring, analysis and reconciliations across customer accounts, payments, disbursements, and repayments. Investigate transaction exceptions and resolve discrepancies within expected turnaround time by engaging with internal teams and external partners. Process and verify back office requests and operational activities accurately and within