ional leads in each market to adapt and roll them out. Ensure operations meet information security, business continuity, data protection, and other regulatory requirements; embed audit-ready controls and documentation into operational workflows in partnership with Compliance, Risk, and Internal Audit. Manage technical service providers and vendors, including performance, contracts, redundancy and failover planning. Oversee operational readiness for product launches and provide input into product design. Own the Operations budget and deliver measurable efficiency gains against it. Build a high-performing operations team; coach team members and stay engaged in delivery. Who you are Operational domain expert with a clear vision for how an efficient organisation should run; grounded in process optimisation, systems and IT management, and digital transformation, and able to set the operating model and direct automation and AI-build teams to implement it. Experienced operator, with 8+ years in operations, including 3+ years leading teams in a fast-paced, high-growth environment. Systems thinker with a strong sense of ownership; translates data and insight into operating decisions, with a track record of cost reduction or process improvement delivered through automation, from concept to scaled delivery. Fluent enough in automation, integrations, and data to scope and direct technical build work, even where you are not writing the code yourself. Skilled at co-designing technology-enabled processes with owners across the organisation. Experienced managing technical vendors and services, including contracts, performance, budget ownership, and compliance. Able to design and build operational processes and controls that scale efficiently as volume grows. Close to the work, hands-on, and quick to solve problems. Familiarity with AI and automation tooling, including low-code platforms is a plus. Experience collaborating across markets in fintech, telecommunications, digital services, or tech-led organizations is a plus. Apply Now Apply Company About Contact Careers Learn Support Lodge a Complaint Whistleblower Portal Our Commitment To Professional Conduct Product Fido Credit Fido Score Credit Breakdown Business Loan Impact Report ESG Report Legals Referral Program T&Cs Legal Discounts Upsales T&C Terms of Service Referral Plan T&C Commitment to info sec. End User License Privacy Policy Cookie Policy Follow Us © All rights are reserved under Fido Microcredit, 2025 Ghana (English)",
