      "url": "https://gh.fido.money/legal-pages/referral-program",
      "description": "Referral Program | Fido Borrow Personal Credit Business Loans Pay Save Build Credit Learn Blog Fido Academy Events Help GH Get the app Get started Referral Program 1. Introduction 1.1. Fido Micro Credit Ltd (Fido) is a private company incorporated in Ghana, regulated and licensed by the Bank of Ghana and is primarily engaged in digital moneylending. 1.2. Fido seeks to leverage existing active, responsible Fido Customers to refer new customers to take Fido Loans (Loan) to drive organic growth through the Fido Referral Program (the Program). 1.3. Through the Program, existing Fido Customers will be able to refer new Fido customers through a weblink generated from the FidoApp to download the Fido App (App), register and apply for Fido Loans (Loan) through the App and successfully receive the Loan. 1.4. All applications for the Loan by the new customers shall be exclusively made and approved using the FidoApp and any other platform that may be created from time to time. 1.5. By referring new customers to apply for the Fido Loan, you agree to these terms and conditions as well as Fido’s End User License Agreement. EULA 1.6. These terms and conditions (the “Terms”) shall be applicable to Fido’s referral program (the “Program”). Where there is any conflict between these Terms and any other communication or marketing material, these Terms will take precedence. 1.7. If you do not agree with these Terms, do not proceed with the application process. ‍ 2.General Overview You warrant and agree that: 2.1. You have legal capacity to enter into a contract with Fido Micro Credit Ltd (“Fido”). 2.2. All the information you provide to Fido in connection with the Program is truthful, accurate, and complete. 2.3. Fido may query third parties for your information for Know Your Customer (KYC) purposes. 2.4. The Program is only open to eligible Fido Customers. ‍ 3. Eligibility/Application Process 3.1. Fido shall open the Program to existing Fido Customers who: a. Are Ghanaian residents aged 18 years and above; b. Opt-in via the Fido App to participate in the Program; c. Consent to testimonial recordings and agree to be featured in Fido’s marketing materials; d. Have taken a minimum number of two (2) Credit Facilities and must not be a loan defaulter, i.e. must have repaid all of his/her loans on time. e. Does not have any repayment arrears at the time of generating the referral code 3.2. The Referee must also: a. be a new Fido customer (i.e. the customer has never taken a Credit Facility from Fido) b. apply for a Credit Facility from Fido using the referral code or link provided to you (the Referee) by Fido; and c. request a drawdown of an amount within fourteen (14) days and receive a disbursement of this amount from Fido. ‍ 3.3 Referrals for the Program through any other channel or with inconsistent phone numbers shall render a Customer ineligible. ‍ 3.4. Employees of Fido and its a ‍ 4. Reward 4.1. If the Fido Customer (the Referrer) successfully refers Fido’s Credit Facility product (the “Credit Facility”) to a prospective new customer (the “Referee”), and such Referee completes the specified eligibility requirements, Fido may, at its sole discretion, provide the Referrer with the following rewards: a. Initial Disbursement Reward: A one-time payment of an amount of GHS 15 shall be paid to the Referrer upon the successful disbursement of the Referee’s first loan under the Credit Facility. b. Timely Repayment Reward: An additional one-time payment of GHS 15 shall be made to the Referrer upon the Referee’s full and timely repayment of the Credit Facility. ‍ 4.2. A referral is considered successful (“ Successful Referra l”) where Fido disburses an amount from a facility offered to your Referee, after your Referee has applied for a Credit Facility based on your referral. ‍ 4.3. The referral code or link given to you must be used by the referee for a Successful Referral within two (2) weeks, after which such link expires. You will not be entitled to receive a reward if the Referee uses the link after two (2) weeks or simply creates a Fido account without a Successful Referral. ‍ 4.4. Each Referrer shall be entitled to up to ten (10) referrals in a year. ‍ 4.5. The Reward shall be disbursed immediately to the registered mobile money wallets of all entitled and Eligible Fido Customers. ‍ 4.6. The Referee shall not be entitled to any reward, compensation, or benefit whatsoever under this Referral Program ‍ 4.7. Referring a new Fido or personal customer does not automatically entitle you to receive the Reward if the new customer does not take a Loan within two (2) weeks after referral. ‍ 4.8. Fido retains the sole discretion to determine whether the eligibility criteria has been fulfilled prior to disbursement of the one-time monetary reward. ‍ 4.9. Fido reserves the right to amend, suspend, or terminate this referral program at any time without prior notice, and all decisions made by Fido regarding eligibility, reward issuance, and interpretation of these terms shall be final and binding. 5. Reward Fulfillment 5.1 Subject to fulfillment of all the eligibility criteria set out above, the Reward shall be paid to the Customer via mobile money transfer to the Customer’s default mobile money wallet used on the FidoApp. ‍ 5.2 The Customer is solely responsible for ensuring that the registered mobile money wallet is active and capable of receiving mobile money payments. ‍ 5.3 If, for any reason, Fido is unable to successfully complete the mobile money transfer to the provided mobile money wallet, the Customer shall be deemed to have forfeited the Reward. ‍ 5.4 In such cases, Fido shall have no responsibility or further obligation to the Customer, and no alternative form of compensation shall be offered. ‍ 5.5 Rewards are subject to availability and may be substituted with equivalent items at Fido’s sole discretion. ‍ 6. Participation Requirements 6.1. To participate in the Program and be considered for the Reward, Eligible",
