      "description": "Fido Academy Home Courses About Fido Download the App Download the App Sign up Download the App Sign up Login Sign up Master Your Financial Future with Fido Academy Practical financial knowledge designed to help you understand money better. Explore course Master Your Financial Future with Fido Academy Practical financial knowledge designed to help you understand money better. Explore courses Why Learn with Fido Academy? Our courses are designed to simplify complex financial concepts and provide you with practical knowledge you can apply immediately. Finance made simple Breaking down complex financial topics into simple, easy to understand lessons. Real-World Application Gain actionable insights that you can apply to your personal finances right away. Self-Paced Learning Learn at your own pace with on-demand video content available 24/7. Master the Core Money Skills Learn the basics that matter most — from managing debt to building long-term financial stability. Foundations of Personal Finance Foundations of Business Finance Responsible Borrowing & Credit Management Psychology of Money Understanding Debt What debt is, how it grows, and how to stay in control of it. Beginner 4 mins Start Lesson How Credit Works How your borrowing behaviour shapes your financial reputation. Beginner 4 mins Start Lesson Budgeting Basics A simple approach to building a financial safety net. Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson Credit Score 101 Find out what a credit score is and why it matters for your financial future. Beginner 3 mins Start Lesson Building Financial Resilience Through Savings Build the habit of saving consistently so you're better prepared for emergencies and future goals. Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson Getting Started with Investing Know more about investing and how it can help your money grow over time. Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson Inflation – Why Your Money Buys Less Over Time Understand how inflation affects the value of your money and what you can do about it.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson What You Should Know About Interest Get to know how interest affects your money when you borrow, save, and invest. Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson Financial Safety and Fraud Prevention Protect yourself, your money, and your financial information from fraud and scams.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 5 mins Start Lesson Managing Your Cash Flow Learn how to manage the money flowing through your business so you can cover your expenses, protect your working capital, and keep the business running.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 5 mins Sign up to access Smart Pricing and Finding Customers Discover how to price your products profitably and attract customers without relying on expensive advertising.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 5 mins Sign up to access Grow Your Business One Step at a Time Explore practical ways to grow your business through clear goals, reinvestment, savings and regular review.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Managing Business Debt Understand when borrowing can help your business and how to avoid taking on debt that could hold it back.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Record Keeping Made Simple See how keeping simple and accurate records can help you track your business performance and make better decisions.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Stock and Inventory Management Master the basics of keeping the right products in stock without tying up too much money in inventory.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Running a Successful Service Business Get practical guidance on managing your time, pricing your services and building loyal customers.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 6 mins Sign up to access Business Risks Identify the risks that can affect your business and practical ways to prepare for them.In this lesson, you'll learn: Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Running a Professional Business Build the habits that help businesses earn trust, manage people effectively and keep improving. Beginner 5 mins Sign up to access Course Refresher Review the key ideas covered throughout the course and reinforce the practical knowledge you can apply to your everyday financial decisions Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Fundamentals of Loans and Borrowing Decisions Understand what loans are, why people borrow, and the responsibilities that come with borrowing money. Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Loan Types and Their Applications Explore the different types of loans and how to choose one that fits your needs and financial situation. Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Pre-Borrowing Evaluation and Risk Considerations Learn how to assess your borrowing needs, costs, and ability to repay before taking a loan. Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Interest Rates and Loan Repayment Costs Understand how interest and other charges affect the total cost of borrowing. Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Building and Maintaining a Good Credit Record Discover how your borrowing and repayment behaviour shapes your credit record and future access to credit. Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Strategies to Avoid Over-Indebtedness Learn how to keep debt manageable and what to do when repayments become difficult. Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Course Refresher Review the key ideas covered throughout the course and reinforce the practical knowledge you can apply to your everyday financial decisions. Beginner 1 mins Sign up to access Understanding Emotional Spending Understand how emotions can influence spending decisions and learn practical ways to create space between a feeling and a purchase. Beginner 5 mins Sign up to access How Emotions and Habits Influence Financial Behaviour Explore how emotions, social influences and repeated behaviours can shape the way you manage money. Beginner 4 mins Sign up to access Common Thinking Errors in Financial Decisions Discover c",
